Take off your gloves and wear a silver ring. To compare the damage 
(note that both of these are against undead or demonic silver haters):

* Blessed +7 silver spear @ Basic:
  * 3.5 (average of d6 vs. small) OR
  * 4.5 (average of d8 vs. large)
  * +6 (STR >= 18/**)
  * +10.5 (average of d20 vs silver haters)
  * +2.5 (average of d4 vs. undead and demons while blessed)
  * Total: avg. 22.5 vs. small, 23.5 vs. large
* Martial Arts @ Grand Master w/silver ring & no gloves:
  * 2.5 (average of d4)
  * +6 (STR >= 18/**)
  * +6.75 (average of 75% chance of +9 for GM)
  * +10.5 (average of d20 vs. silver haters)
  * Total: avg. 26.75

No blessed damage for MA because you need gloves for that, which kills 
your silver damage in that case; even without it, though, MA - gloves + 
silver ring beats silver spear for damage, and can stagger a monster, 
knocking it back. Doing some quick calculations, MA still compares 
favorably to silver spear even when merely at Expert. Indeed, Martial 
Arts compares favorably to virtually any non-artifact, and even most 
artifacts.
